      "text": "pytest-6.2 »"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "跳过和xfail：处理无法成功的测试"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "跳过和xfail：处理无法成功的测试¶"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "您可以标记不能在某些平台上运行或预期会失败的测试函数，以便pytest可以相应地处理它们，并在保留测试套件的同时提供测试会话的摘要 绿色 ."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "A skip 意味着您希望只有在满足某些条件时测试才能通过，否则pytest应该跳过运行测试。常见的例子是跳过非Windows平台上的仅限Windows的测试，或者跳过依赖于当前不可用的外部资源（例如数据库）的测试。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "安 X失效 意味着您希望某个测试由于某种原因而失败。一个常见的例子是对尚未实现的特性或尚未修复的错误的测试。当测试通过时，尽管预期会失败（标记为 pytest.mark.xfail 这是一个 XPASS 并将在测试总结中报告。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "pytest 计数和列表 skip 和 X失效 单独测试。默认情况下，不会显示有关跳过的/xfailed测试的详细信息，以避免混淆输出。你可以使用 -r 查看与测试进度中显示的“短”字母对应的详细信息的选项："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "pytest -rxXs # show extra info on xfailed, xpassed, and skipped tests"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "有关 -r 可以通过运行找到选项 pytest -h ."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "（见 内置配置文件选项 ）"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "跳过测试函数¶"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "跳过测试函数的最简单方法是用 skip 可以传递可选 reason ："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "@pytest.mark.skip(reason=\"no way of currently testing this\")\ndef test_the_unknown():\n..."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "或者，也可以通过调用 pytest.skip(reason) 功能："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "def test_function():\nif not valid_config():\npytest.skip(\"unsupported configuration\")"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "当无法在导入期间评估跳过条件时，命令式方法非常有用。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "也可以跳过整个模块，使用 pytest.skip(reason, allow_module_level=True) 在模块级别："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "import sys\nimport pytest\n\nif not sys.platform.startswith(\"win\"):\npytest.skip(\"skipping windows-only tests\", allow_module_level=True)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考文献 ： pytest.mark.skip"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "skipif¶"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "如果您希望有条件地跳过某些内容，则可以使用 skipif 相反。以下是在python3.6之前的解释器上运行时将测试函数标记为跳过的示例："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "import sys\n\n@pytest.mark.skipif(sys.version_info < (3, 7), reason=\"requires python3.7 or higher\")\ndef test_function():\n..."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "如果条件评估为 True 在收集期间，将跳过测试函数，使用时在摘要中显示指定的原因 -rs ."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "你可以分享 skipif 模块之间的标记。考虑这个测试模块："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "# content of test_mymodule.py\nimport mymodule\n\nminversion = pytest.mark.skipif(\nmymodule.__versioninfo__ < (1, 1), reason=\"at least mymodule-1.1 required\"\n)\n\n@minversion\ndef test_function():\n..."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "您可以导入标记并在另一个测试模块中重用它："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "# test_myothermodule.py\nfrom test_mymodule import minversion\n\n@minversion\ndef test_anotherfunction():\n..."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "对于较大的测试套件，最好有一个文件定义标记，然后在整个测试套件中一致地应用这些标记。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "或者，您可以使用 condition strings 而不是布尔值，但是它们不容易在模块之间共享，因此主要是出于向后兼容性的原因才支持它们。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考文献 ： pytest.mark.skipif"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "跳过类或模块的所有测试函数¶"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "你可以使用 skipif 类上的标记（作为任何其他标记）："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "@pytest.mark.skipif(sys.platform == \"win32\", reason=\"does not run on windows\")\nclass TestPosixCalls:\ndef test_function(self):\n\"will not be setup or run under 'win32' platform\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "如果条件是 True ，此标记将为该类的每个测试方法生成跳过结果。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "如果要跳过模块的所有测试功能，可以使用 pytestmark 全球的："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "# test_module.py\npytestmark = pytest.mark.skipif(...)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "中频倍数 skipif 修饰符应用于测试函数，如果任何跳过条件为真，则将跳过它。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "跳过文件或目录¶"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "有时可能需要跳过整个文件或目录，例如，如果测试依赖于特定于Python版本的功能或包含不希望运行pytest的代码。在这种情况下，必须从集合中排除文件和目录。参照 自定义测试集合 更多信息。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "跳过缺少的导入依赖项¶"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "您可以使用 pytest.importorskip 在模块级，在测试或测试设置功能内。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "docutils = pytest.importorskip(\"docutils\")"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "如果 docutils 无法在此处导入，这将导致跳过测试结果。也可以根据库的版本号跳过："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "docutils = pytest.importorskip(\"docutils\", minversion=\"0.3\")"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "版本将从指定的模块中读取 __version__ 属性。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "总结¶"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "以下是如何在不同情况下跳过模块中的测试的快速指南："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "无条件跳过模块中的所有测试："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "pytestmark = pytest.mark.skip(\"all tests still WIP\")"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "根据某些条件跳过模块中的所有测试："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "pytestmark = pytest.mark.skipif(sys.platform == \"win32\", reason=\"tests for linux only\")"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "如果缺少某些导入，则跳过模块中的所有测试："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "pexpect = pytest.importorskip(\"pexpect\")"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "xfail：将测试功能标记为预期失败¶"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "你可以使用 xfail 标记以指示预期测试失败："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "@pytest.mark.xfail\ndef test_function():\n..."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "此测试将运行，但失败时不会报告回溯。相反，终端报告会将其列在“预期失败”中 (XFAIL ）或“意外通过” (XPASS 部分。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "或者，也可以将测试标记为 XFAIL 必须从测试或其设置功能中："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "def test_function():\nif not valid_config():\npytest.xfail(\"failing configuration (but should work)\")"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "def test_function2():\nimport slow_module\n\nif slow_module.slow_function():\npytest.xfail(\"slow_module taking too long\")"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "这两个示例说明了您不希望在模块级别检查条件的情况，也就是说，在这种情况下，条件将被评估为标记。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "这将使 test_function XFAIL . 注意，在 pytest.xfail() 呼叫，与标记不同。这是因为它是通过引发一个已知的异常在内部实现的。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考文献 ： pytest.mark.xfail"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "condition 参数¶"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "如果测试只在特定条件下失败，则可以将该条件作为第一个参数通过："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "@pytest.mark.xfail(sys.platform == \"win32\", reason=\"bug in a 3rd party library\")\ndef test_function():\n..."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "请注意，您还必须传递一个原因（请参阅 pytest.mark.xfail ）"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "reason 参数¶"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "可以使用 reason 参数："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "@pytest.mark.xfail(reason=\"known parser issue\")\ndef test_function():\n..."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "raises 参数¶"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "如果要更具体地说明测试失败的原因，可以在 raises 参数。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "@pytest.mark.xfail(raises=RuntimeError)\ndef test_function():\n..."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "如果测试失败，则报告为常规失败，除非 raises ."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "run 参数¶"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "如果测试应标记为xfail并报告为xfail，但不应执行，则使用 run 参数AS False ："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "@pytest.mark.xfail(run=False)\ndef test_function():\n..."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "这对于Xfailing测试特别有用，这些测试会使解释器崩溃，应该稍后进行调查。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "strict 参数¶"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "两个 XFAIL 和 XPASS 默认情况下不要让测试套件失败。您可以通过设置 strict 仅关键字参数到 True ："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "@pytest.mark.xfail(strict=True)\ndef test_function():\n..."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "这将使 XPASS 此测试的（“意外通过”）结果将使测试套件失败。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "您可以更改 strict 参数使用 xfail_strict ini选项："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "[pytest]\nxfail_strict=true"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "忽略x失败¶"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "通过在命令行上指定："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "pytest --runxfail"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "您可以强制运行和报告 xfail 将测试标记为完全没有标记。这也导致 pytest.xfail() 不产生效果。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "实例¶"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "下面是一个简单的测试文件，有几种用法："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "import pytest\n\nxfail = pytest.mark.xfail\n\n@xfail\ndef test_hello():\nassert 0\n\n@xfail(run=False)\ndef test_hello2():\nassert 0\n\n@xfail(\"hasattr(os, 'sep')\")\ndef test_hello3():\nassert 0\n\n@xfail(reason=\"bug 110\")\ndef test_hello4():\nassert 0\n\n@xfail('pytest.__version__[0] != \"17\"')\ndef test_hello5():\nassert 0\n\ndef test_hello6():\npytest.xfail(\"reason\")\n\n@xfail(raises=IndexError)\ndef test_hello7():\nx = []\nx[1] = 1"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "使用“报告xfail”选项运行它可以得到以下输出："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "example $ pytest -rx xfail_demo.py\n=========================== test session starts ============================\nplatform linux -- Python 3.x.y, pytest-6.x.y, py-1.x.y, pluggy-0.x.y\ncachedir: $PYTHON_PREFIX/.pytest_cache\nrootdir: $REGENDOC_TMPDIR/example\ncollected 7 items\n\nxfail_demo.py xxxxxxx [100%]\n\n========================= short test summary info ==========================\nXFAIL xfail_demo.py::test_hello\nXFAIL xfail_demo.py::test_hello2\nreason: [NOTRUN]\nXFAIL xfail_demo.py::test_hello3\ncondition: hasattr(os, 'sep')\nXFAIL xfail_demo.py::test_hello4\nbug 110\nXFAIL xfail_demo.py::test_hello5\ncondition: pytest.__version__[0] != \"17\"\nXFAIL xfail_demo.py::test_hello6\nreason: reason\nXFAIL xfail_demo.py::test_hello7\n============================ 7 xfailed in 0.12s ============================"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "跳过/xfail，参数化¶"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "当使用参数化时，可以对单个测试实例应用诸如skip和xfail之类的标记："
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "import sys\nimport pytest\n\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(\n(\"n\", \"expected\"),\n[\n(1, 2),\npytest.param(1, 0, marks=pytest.mark.xfail),\npytest.param(1, 3, marks=pytest.mark.xfail(reason=\"some bug\")),\n(2, 3),\n(3, 4),\n(4, 5),\npytest.param(\n10, 11, marks=pytest.mark.skipif(sys.version_info >= (3, 0), reason=\"py2k\")\n),\n],\n)\ndef test_increment(n, expected):\nassert n + 1 == expected"
    },
